# Motif needs no environment variable today: each visitor links their own AI account in the app,
# and OPENAI_API_KEY is no longer read.
#
# When the server gets a secret of its own, list its name here without the value, and put the
# value in .env for local development (`npm run dev` reads it) or in the host's environment.
# Never give a server-side secret a VITE_ prefix, which would ship it to the browser.
